# Flag pour l'execution Valgrind :

	valgrind --leak-check=full --show-leak-kinds=all --track-origins=yes --track-fds=yes --trace-children=yes --suppressions=valgrind.supp ./minishell

# Fichier valgrind.supp :

	{
	   readline_leak
	   Memcheck:Leak
	   match-leak-kinds: reachable
	   ...
	   obj:*/libreadline.so*
	   ...
	}

	{
	   libtinfo_leak
	   Memcheck:Leak
	   match-leak-kinds: reachable
	   ...
	   obj:*/libtinfo.so*
	   ...
	}

# Parsing : 

- CAT : "cat sad asd" ; 
result ->	/usr/bin/cat: sad: No such file or directory
			/usr/bin/cat: asd: No such file or directory

		"< Makefile cat | cat -e"
result ->	nothing
should be the Makefile with $ at each end of line


- BASH : ls > a | < a cat --> a: No such file or directory
- Minishell : ls > a | < a cat --> write in file but do not display "a: No such file or directory"

